OL,3,ADozens killed in Myanmar military
OL,4,Astrikes on wedding venue and school
OL,5,
OL,6,FAir strikes by Myanmar's military have
OL,7,Fkilled dozens of people across the
OL,8,FSouth East Asian nation, including at a
OL,9,Fwedding venue and a school.
OL,11,FRescuers said at least 21 were
OL,12,Fconfirmed dead, and at least 35 others
OL,13,Finjured, at the wedding site in Moe Bye
OL,14,Fvillage, in the country's southern Shan
OL,15,Fstate, on Saturday afternoon.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
